  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0025_3ee66f5883a6.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 46px;\" /><br /><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0025_e2d851cc6a51.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 80px;\" /><br /><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> real solutions."
